Each render target has its own scale. This function gets the scale for the current render target.

This function should only be called on the main thread.

=over

=item renderer - SDL3::Renderer object or undef. the rendering context.

=item scaleX - reference to a scalar holding number, pointer object or undef. a pointer filled in with the horizontal scaling factor.

=item scaleY - reference to a scalar holding number, pointer object or undef. a pointer filled in with the vertical scaling factor.

